Fix repository pagination in lowlighter/metrics v3.34 (source/plugins/base/index.mjs)

1. When a repositories query fails (usually a GraphQL timeout), the batch is halved and the loop
   does `continue`. In a do/while that jumps to the condition, which is false on the first page,
   so the loop exits with 0 repositories. Everything computed from repositories then renders
   empty (languages, stars, license...) and the traffic plugin reports "Insufficient token scopes".
   Fixed by marking the page for a retry.
2. A page was treated as the last one when it returned fewer than `repositories` (100) results
   rather than fewer than the batch size, so `repositories_batch` < 100 only ever fetched one page.

